        actual: 'Savings surrendered on last day: Ayurveda 30.69% (₹1,728 Cr), Homeopathy 23.68% (₹615 Cr), Unani 33.60% (₹230 Cr) — every year, for 5 consecutive years. 71% vacancy (538 posts) in 11 functional FIAHs. 528 of 1,034 sanctioned HWCs without internet; 219 without electricity as of Jan 2025. State Pharmacy produced only 59.94% of approved medicine types at 51.35% of target quantity.',
