        actual: 'Net sector deficit: ₹30,223 crore (losses exceed profits 15×). Power distribution companies dominate the loss list. CAG\'s financial statement comments had a ₹4,686 crore impact on reported profitability and ₹10,376 crore on financial position — indicating systematic accounting misrepresentation. GoUP has invested ₹1,74,333 crore (42% of total SPSE investment) in equity and long-term loans.',
