        actual: 'Original 1982 estimate: ₹299.20 crore. Final cost: ₹10,003.11 crore. Drivers: 43-year delay compounding price inflation, incorrect rate analysis, overestimation, land acquisition dragging for decades, tenders invited without technical sanctions. 80% of the 11.29 lakh hectare CCA remains without functioning canal distribution.',
